+### Changed
+- `sys::termios::BaudRate` now implements `TryFrom<speed_t>` instead of
+  `From<speed_t>`.  The old `From` implementation would panic on failure.
+  ([#1159](https://github.com/nix-rust/nix/pull/1159))
